- [ ] `source .env.test && cargo test --test memory_episode_test observer_job_schema_migration_transaction`
- [ ] `source .env.test && cargo test --test memory_episode_test terminal_observation_snapshot_retention_and_redaction`

**Dependencies:** M2-01K（全串行前置已冻结类型/schema 与 repository keyed-digest 基础）。

**Deliverables:** N/A。

**Implementation write set:** `sql/migrations/2026092101_memory_core.sql`、`sql/migrations/2026092101_memory_core_down.sql`、`src/internal/db/migration.rs`、`tests/SERIAL_REGISTRY.tsv`、`.config/nextest.toml`、`src/internal/model/memory_*`、`src/internal/model/mod.rs`、`tests/db_migration_test.rs`、`tests/memory_episode_test.rs`、`tests/INDEX.md`、`sql/migrations/README.md`。

**Release write set:** `Inherited`（= ER-08 版本面集合（以 `compat_version_surface_sync` 为权威；当前三处） + `Cargo.lock` + release artifact）。

